@demoProject_HostAddress = https://localhost:5000/api

### Test Shipment Rating Status API

# Check rating status for a specific shipment (replace with actual shipment ID)
GET {{demoProject_HostAddress}}/shipments/3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6/rating-status
Accept: application/json

